* PURSUIT-1 brushed motor drive stage - worst case locked rotor, 32kHz 60% duty
V1 batt 0 4.2
Rbat batt vbat 0.05
C1 vbat 0 220u Rser=0.03
Vg drv 0 PULSE(0 3.3 5u 30n 30n 18.75u 31.25u)
Rg drv gate 100
Rpd gate 0 10k
M1 sw gate 0 0 AO3400
D1 sw vbat SS34
Rm vbat mm 0.8
Lm mm sw 100u
.model AO3400 VDMOS(Rg=1.6 Rd=9m Rs=9m Vto=1.05 Kp=30 Lambda=0.05 Cgdmax=0.35n Cgdmin=0.03n Cgs=0.45n Cjo=0.35n Is=8n)
.model SS34 D(Is=1e-5 Rs=0.03 N=1.3 Cjo=250p M=0.5 Eg=0.69 BV=40)
.tran 0 1m 0 100n
.meas TRAN Isteady AVG I(Lm) FROM 0.8m TO 1m
.meas TRAN Ipk MAX I(Lm)
.meas TRAN Vsw_clamp MAX V(sw)
.meas TRAN Vbat_sag MIN V(vbat)
.meas TRAN Pfet AVG V(sw)*Id(M1) FROM 0.8m TO 1m
.meas TRAN Vgate_hi MAX V(gate)
.end
